      "path": "src/ui/screens/PositionChangeFormBody.tsx",
      "content": "A missing-reason issue permanently forces `asksWhy` until another workflow call replaces `issues`, even when execution edits make the sale follow the Plan. For example, enter a partial sale, click Save with no reason, then change it to the full quantity at the Stop: the UI says “Nothing more to ask” but still shows the question and blocks Save locally. This also happens after a workflow refusal. Scope the refusal override to the execution values it was reported against, and invalidate/re-evaluate it when quantity, price, or economic time changes. Add a regression test for correcting the sale after the empty-reason refusal.",
